y cron'=>'Naka-schedule na pang-linggong cron','Terms added successfully'=>'Matagumpay na nadagdag ang mga term','Auto Terms settings do not exist.'=>'Walang umiiral na Auto Terms settings.','Auto Terms settings are configured to skip posts with terms.'=>'Ang Auto Terms settings ay naka-configure upang laktawan ang mga post na may mga term.','Post content is empty.'=>'Walang laman ang nilalaman ng post.','No new matching terms for Auto Terms settings and the post content.'=>'Walang bagong tumutugmang mga term para sa Auto Terms settings at ang nilalaman ng post.','No new matching terms for Auto Terms settings and the post content. However, the existing terms were removed due to the Auto Terms replacement settings.'=>'Walang bagong tumutugmang mga term para sa Auto Terms settings at ang nilalaman ng post. Gayunpaman, ang mga umiiral na term ay tinanggal dahil sa Auto Terms replacement settings.','Post type'=>'post type','Source'=>'Pinagmulan','Status message'=>'Mensaheng status','Settings'=>'Mga Setting','Filter'=>'Salain','Select all auto terms logs'=>'Pumili ng lahat ng auto terms logs','Post'=>'Post','Terms added'=>'Nagdagdag ng mga termino','Date'=>'Petsa','Select auto terms log %s'=>'Pumili ng auto terms log %s','Edit Main Post'=>'I-edit ang Pangunahing Post','Delete Log'=>'Tanggalin ang Log','Limit the number of logs'=>'Limitahan ang bilang ng mga log','Update'=>'I-update','Auto terms'=>'Auto terms','Post Type'=>'Post Type','Existing taxonomy terms'=>'Existing taxonomy terms','OpenAI'=>'OpenAI','AI Connectors'=>'AI Connectors','IBM Watson'=>'IBM Watson','Dandelion'=>'Dandelion','LSEG / Refinitiv'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv','Auto Terms'=>'Auto Terms','Auto Terms Logs'=>'Auto Terms Logs','Add New Auto Terms'=>'Add New Auto Terms','Enable Logs'=>'Enable Logs','Are you sure you want to disable logs?'=>'Are you sure you want to disable logs?','Disable Logs'=>'Disable Logs','Are you sure you want to delete all logs?'=>'Are you sure you want to delete all logs?','Delete All 